-436d-8750-62a244d8af44\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5a84323f-a9cc-469c-9bcc-f3f977325edf\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3e67edef-842d-4379-88fb-3201ffdd8cb1\">안녕하세요. </span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-70f7db1d-f573-4585-a0b8-1bd65267c43b\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8a6fcdc0-2395-4f8c-8d88-5ae802e9b0b9\">입니다.​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-91342f54-02b1-400e-a48b-ff155e8cfbe6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-78711ed4-3db2-4091-a535-945b6072b901\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-25ada35c-2a55-43b0-a798-475107a4769f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b5cdc86f-7031-4525-a395-ad86504f0282\">8/11(월) 16:00 ~ 18:00 경에</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-32f55855-d75e-4659-8848-0e3fea1700f1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5fa16c97-8bed-44e0-a791-00b53de65688\">무점검 업데이트가 진행됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7dc91479-00be-4066-9f3b-69aa08f2be70\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-440986d5-d29d-4232-bbeb-119c0227df02\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-67a8f302-4252-480a-be01-242a03ff2c73\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d763dbad-2481-40f1-b8c8-e52d9f3e30ac\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fb9ea4bc-a2f6-4385-b97f-9a93bea4ec11\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-881a4c06-e953-4fa5-a46e-9b4cb42da68e\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5c23eaef-6ff6-4b90-b452-3ddb11cd7a7f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-438685e9-dbd0-44e6-b0ce-be602e5cb12a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7785b7ad-6063-4b3c-9ea0-9d37adab88c6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a8dcec1d-6b3d-4083-ba72-1a12856ad0d8\">​​자세한 내용은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3e07a3fb-86c7-4f14-9935-45a60b201ece\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0345faae-41b8-4377-9efa-01aba0c747cb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-405f16f2-9e58-46d3-8ef6-c315c619e80a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e47d47ef-f1f6-4a81-bb22-17c38a2d3aaf\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fbba68e1-10f3-4d17-a0d5-92b278fe6a88\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-914d445d-636e-49f2-bcef-53eedd995be7\"><b>📢 8/11(월) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-136edb0a-d3c6-41fd-a11e-45371cdc3b2e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-138137ed-22c1-42d7-87c0-7a064e4903c3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0ab6ddd7-3bd1-47c7-bbba-e4b60ba25fa5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0b469261-596b-4550-b05d-54d1888f7f2c\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e5f9ec6a-668b-45cc-9886-56af0bc8b255\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-da11d81a-a837-4334-947c-3c62ae6c0aa4\">- 8/11(월) 16:00 ~ 18:00 경​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bb1072cb-d69f-4994-9330-0d9d0e562e77\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ff89db37-0d72-4d48-98c2-0696cc6aa165\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-04b1d27e-49a3-4097-a41a-40422820db62\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ee301a79-25e0-49f6-ba3a-184f58887f22\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-38b458e4-be9b-460e-9ce1-3636ff20d51d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-a8cb91c8-768f-4631-931f-4d853d9a2423\">1. 솔로 레이드 뮤지엄 전투 중 특정 상황에서 화면 상단의 일부 정보가 초기화되어 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-675c863b-1c01-443d-9bb9-2a0bd6f4e8ff\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-2723fc6b-5fad-47c0-b1d1-c7394a904d90\">2. 솔로 레이드 뮤지엄에서 마더웨일과 전투 중 특정 상황에서 마더웨일의 전투 패턴이 의도와 다르게 동작하는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-07bdd0dc-bb9e-4a6b-b4c3-8c6514f8a23d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-294e465e-f0fa-4199-b558-0baa1c7934ea\">3. 특정 환경에서 캠페인 22-36 노멀 및 하드 스테이지의 전투가 정상적으로 진행되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b51b2749-7766-4d3b-a21c-a8013d77a47b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-77f39d22-7b81-45dc-975c-c6968658befd\">4. 일본어 음성 환경에서 스토리 이벤트 ABSOLUTE 시나리오의 대사와 일치하지 않는 일부 음성을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-202470ff-f68f-4cf8-a107-2f9d6cdb380d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c8b2481f-b4c3-4d80-99ad-ce54cf8ba327\">5. 베스티 : 택티컬 업 버스트 스킬 「미사일 컨테이너 온라인」의 설명에서 일부 문구를 기존 표현과 같이 통일하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70e7479d-dd04-49a9-b980-1ffe90135f0c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-6c8b307e-3fcc-44cb-8c65-506422672704\">└ 방어 무시 버스트 스킬 대미지 → 방어력 무시 버스트 스킬 대미지</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-995b56f0-357c-4af5-9af9-cc00ed2c18b7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-cb6c3a1c-cdc9-435c-b111-27e8f443a895\">└ 실제 효과는 기존과 동일합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4faf21d5-1e15-4984-83a3-32ec3b6e19b6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-8c6a8295-8dbb-4f92-ab2e-8c44fc23187f\">6. 일부 스킬 설명 중 [발사체 폭발 대미지]에 대한 스킬 정보 팝업을 추가하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c35fa00c-bb97-4739-a957-a25ad4eaa3b6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4c19d908-ddee-41df-bc21-f0aebcb3fdb2\">[대상]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-32410af3-48f8-4021-a306-55d2713cb4c0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-8834426b-6d91-4d72-9cbf-27b5e37c1bf7\">└ 엠마 : 택티컬 업 스킬2 「포메이션 LT」</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-08f42fe4-ecba-40cf-81a1-d395e5ab2e31\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-6ae8cdfb-ae16-4ea5-b2b4-ec7b201433e4\">└ 은화 : 택티컬 업 스킬2 「포메이션 AS」</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0b309df7-5cf9-47dd-abca-77ce2affe894\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-d062a236-6a86-4855-b56a-e08cc977805d\">7. 영어 음성 환경의 일부 음성이 어색한 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9abf65f1-53b7-4048-beac-f16101bd2c9d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4122110d-e563-4e9f-9d7b-0fe34f0380a9\">[대상]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bec2c567-504b-43e4-8209-05f7f150a3b0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-32b7458e-1a8f-4db4-86ee-e23764fb9b03\">└ 캠페인 39, 40 챕터</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d48f112d-7d76-4fcf-88f2-9420ef79e296\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-15e2b543-e2bd-49d9-b4af-3100a913986a\">└ 스토리 이벤트 : ABSOLUTE</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d5dda220-0249-49ab-9b8e-5ba8efac4076\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4eb0b026-1d59-458b-a449-74aa7181eeee\">└ 복귀 이벤트</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-102717c3-6a5f-47c3-a334-9b5d7ce4fd5c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-9c45d559-6ce4-4877-890a-827f2c52ecd8\">└ 엠마 : 택티컬 업</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c50d5253-228e-4747-9e36-71a7730b4d6f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-5facbe2f-d6b7-41db-818b-3d27f4208c59\">└ 은화 : 택티컬 업</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a40c49b8-94f7-47b3-9049-959048652c18\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-d8adc7da-38a0-47ee-aea7-711768bc1c12\">└ 베스티 : 택티컬 업</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f0847baf-657d-44ed-b8ac-84da7cb6105e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-42553ba0-974e-4644-adf9-878f1cd15ba4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cb589c5a-098b-449a-ad31-1efa8cc6edc2\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-101a9142-beea-4701-b0a2-52260ccbf999\">​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4ca5a5c0-0b0e-4678-a0ed-66bbd621cc64\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a9f44659-a4d6-4210-a390-fafe6c5a2b75\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5b2ea8e4-77d0-46e1-91d4-93d6d87888db\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c5de20ef-5222-45a9-aa01-41659b804cbe\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e7d18088-ddcf-482d-8090-730f3e3bacf4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4400321f-1cee-4dc7-b585-11671364d664\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c8aa829b-c78c-4bb1-9227-4ad7d122f054\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b258a227-59b8-4d8b-942e-25004dce9f2d\">게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE